## Resolution Summary
All three review comments were addressed with the exact suggested fixes, plus corresponding test cases were added for each. WaitForExternalSecret now handles NotFound as a normal not-ready state, GetTLSSecret validates that tls.crt and tls.key are present before returning, and RunJob treats AlreadyExists on replacement Create as a transient condition. Each fix also added a dedicated test: TestWaitForExternalSecret_notFound (secrets_test.go), TestGetTLSSecret_missingTLSKeys (tls_test.go), and TestRunJob_existingComplete_specChanged_alreadyExists (job_test.go).

